@title Wire numbering window says numbers are per potential (B-07)
@area Schematic
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The window states how many numbers cover how many wires, so "13 numbered for 17 wires" is not a surprise.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text "wire numbering"
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
expect "Numbers ("
expect "wires"
expect "share one number"
shot numbering-scope
check_layout
